<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'For Schools — Evo Meals School Meal Management Platform' }) %>
<meta name="description" content="Evo Meals partners with schools to run their school meal program in Kuwait digitally — automated subscriptions and orders, student-level meal accuracy, real-time dashboards, and a revenue-sharing partnership model.">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/sitenav', { active: 'schools' }) %>

<section class="hero hero-inner-page">
  <div class="wrap-wide">
    <div class="hero-copy" data-reveal style="max-width:680px;">
      <span class="eyebrow on-dark">For Schools</span>
      <h1>Turn your school meal program into a digital experience.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Replace paper forms, WhatsApp coordination, and manual reconciliation with one platform your administration, your parents, and your catering partner all use — built as a partnership, not a software sale.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#partner-form" class="btn btn-primary">Partner with us</a>
        <a href="/how-it-works" class="btn btn-ghost">See how the platform works</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="benefits">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Seven reasons schools choose Evo Meals</span>
      <h2>What actually changes for your administration.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="benefit-icon-grid">
      <div class="benefit-card" data-reveal data-reveal-group="benefits">
        <div class="benefit-card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 6h13M8 12h13M8 18h13M3 6h.01M3 12h.01M3 18h.01"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Reduce Administrative Work</h3>
        <p>Subscriptions and orders run themselves — no more chasing forms.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit-card" data-reveal data-reveal-group="benefits">
        <div class="benefit-card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 8a6 6 0 0 0-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9"/><path d="M13.7 21a2 2 0 0 1-3.4 0"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Increase Parent Engagement</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit-card" data-reveal data-reveal-group="benefits">
        <div class="benefit-card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 8.5a8 8 0 0 1 12 0M8.5 11a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 7 0M12 14v.01"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Improve Meal Accuracy</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit-card" data-reveal data-reveal-group="benefits">
        <div class="benefit-card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 19V10M12 19V4M20 19v-7"/></svg></div>
        <h3>New Revenue Opportunities</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit-card" data-reveal data-reveal-group="benefits">
        <div class="benefit-card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12s3.5-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.5 7-10 7-10-7-10-7Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Real-Time Visibility</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit-card" data-reveal data-reveal-group="benefits">
        <div class="benefit-card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 15a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6Z"/><path d="m4.2 10.9 1.7-.6a7.9 7.9 0 0 1 1-1.7l-.3-1.8 1.7-1 1.5 1.1a7.9 7.9 0 0 1 2 0l1.5-1.1 1.7 1-.3 1.8c.4.5.8 1.1 1 1.7l1.7.6v2l-1.7.6a7.9 7.9 0 0 1-1 1.7l.3 1.8-1.7 1-1.5-1.1a7.9 7.9 0 0 1-2 0l-1.5 1.1-1.7-1 .3-1.8a7.9 7.9 0 0 1-1-1.7l-1.7-.6Z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>A Professional Experience</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit-card benefit-card-wide" data-reveal data-reveal-group="benefits">
        <div class="benefit-card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 3a2.83 2.83 0 0 1 4 4L7 21l-5 1 1-5Z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>A Real Partnership</h3>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-tint" id="school-operations">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Once you're on the platform</span>
      <h2>What a school actually does, day to day.</h2>
      <p>The seven benefits above are the pitch. This is the operational reality once your program is live.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="teaser-list operate-list" data-reveal>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Digitize meal management</li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Manage students</li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Monitor meal subscriptions</li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Receive reports</li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Communicate with parents</li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Generate revenue</li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Promote school activities</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="partner-form">
  <div class="wrap partner-form-wrap">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal style="margin:0 0 0;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Partner with us</span>
      <h2>Let's talk about your school's program.</h2>
      <p>This starts a real conversation, not a signup. Tell us about your school and a member of our partnerships team will respond <strong>within one business day</strong> to set up menus, plans, and parent onboarding together.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card" data-reveal>
      <% if (typeof success !== 'undefined' && success) { %>
        <div class="alert alert-success"><%- include('partials/success-icon') %><span>Thank you — we've received your inquiry and will be in touch within one business day.</span></div>
      <% } else { %>
        <% var fd = (typeof formData !== 'undefined' && formData) ? formData : {}; var errs = (typeof errors !== 'undefined' && errors) ? errors : {}; %>
        <form method="POST" action="/schools/inquiry" id="schoolInquiryForm" novalidate>
          <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
          <div class="field <%= errs.organizationName ? 'invalid' : '' %>">
            <label for="schoolOrgName">School name</label>
            <input type="text" id="schoolOrgName" name="organizationName" value="<%= fd.organizationName || '' %>" required data-validate="required">
            <div class="field-error"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 8v5M12 16h.01"/></svg><span><%= errs.organizationName || 'School name is required.' %></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="field <%= errs.contactName ? 'invalid' : '' %>">
              <label for="schoolContactName">Contact person</label>
              <input type="text" id="schoolContactName" name="contactName" value="<%= fd.contactName || '' %>" required data-validate="required">
              <div class="field-error"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 8v5M12 16h.01"/></svg><span><%= errs.contactName || 'Contact person is required.' %></span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="schoolContactRole">Their role</label>
              <input type="text" id="schoolContactRole" name="contactRole" value="<%= fd.contactRole || '' %>" placeholder="e.g. Principal, Operations Manager">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="field <%= errs.email ? 'invalid' : '' %>">
              <label for="schoolContactEmail">Email</label>
              <input type="email" id="schoolContactEmail" name="email" value="<%= fd.email || '' %>" inputmode="email" required data-validate="email">
              <div class="field-error"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 8v5M12 16h.01"/></svg><span><%= errs.email || 'A valid email address is required.' %></span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="schoolContactPhone">Phone</label>
              <input type="tel" id="schoolContactPhone" name="phone" value="<%= fd.phone || '' %>" inputmode="tel">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="schoolScale">Number of students</label>
              <select id="schoolScale" name="scaleInfo">
                <option value="Under 200" <%= fd.scaleInfo === 'Under 200' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Under 200</option>
                <option value="200–500" <%= fd.scaleInfo === '200–500' ? 'selected' : '' %>>200–500</option>
                <option value="500–1,000" <%= fd.scaleInfo === '500–1,000' ? 'selected' : '' %>>500–1,000</option>
                <option value="1,000+" <%= fd.scaleInfo === '1,000+' ? 'selected' : '' %>>1,000+</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="schoolArrangement">Current meal arrangement</label>
              <select id="schoolArrangement" name="currentArrangement">
                <option value="No formal program" <%= fd.currentArrangement === 'No formal program' ? 'selected' : '' %>>No formal program</option>
                <option value="Informal caterer arrangement" <%= fd.currentArrangement === 'Informal caterer arrangement' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Informal caterer arrangement</option>
                <option value="Existing digital system" <%= fd.currentArrangement === 'Existing digital system' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Existing digital system</option>
                <option value="Other" <%= fd.currentArrangement === 'Other' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Other</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field <%= errs.message ? 'invalid' : '' %>">
            <label for="schoolMessage">Tell us more</label>
            <textarea id="schoolMessage" name="message" rows="4" required data-validate="minlength:10" placeholder="Anything else that would help us prepare for the conversation..."><%= fd.message || '' %></textarea>
            <div class="field-error"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 8v5M12 16h.01"/></svg><span><%= errs.message || 'Tell us a little more — at least 10 characters.' %></span></div>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%;">Send to our partnerships team</button>
        </form>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;">
    <span class="eyebrow on-dark" style="justify-content:center;">Ready when you are</span>
    <h2 style="margin-top:16px;">See what Evo Meals looks like for your school.</h2>
    <p style="margin:14px auto 28px;">No commitment — just a conversation about whether this is a fit.</p>
    <a href="#partner-form" class="btn btn-primary">Partner with us</a>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/sitefoot') %>

</body>
</html>
